WEBVTT

01:38.560 --> 01:41.880
BASED ON THE NOVEL
"THE PRISONER OF BEAUTY" BY PENGLAI KE

01:48.640 --> 01:51.120
You two, I suggest you surrender.

01:52.840 --> 01:54.240
This is Yanzhou.

01:54.320 --> 01:57.000
How can a Liangya man be in charge?

01:59.040 --> 02:00.680
Soldiers, you might not know,

02:01.640 --> 02:02.920
but your governor

02:03.400 --> 02:06.120
was killed in Panyi
by the Lord of Liangya.

02:07.080 --> 02:08.560
Liangya is hiding this

02:09.199 --> 02:11.200
to divide Yanzhou later.

02:11.840 --> 02:12.880
Really?

02:15.160 --> 02:16.520
My brother is dead?

02:16.600 --> 02:18.560
Qiao Yue is dead.

02:19.360 --> 02:22.400
So, the prefect is the governor now.

02:23.400 --> 02:24.320
Are you sure

02:24.800 --> 02:26.600
you want to fight him now?

02:27.840 --> 02:28.720
Don't listen to him.

02:28.800 --> 02:30.120
Seize these two immediately.

02:30.200 --> 02:31.640
The Lord of Liangya is offering
a great reward!

02:31.720 --> 02:33.480
The Wei army will soon crush Panyi.

02:33.560 --> 02:35.880
The Lord of Liangya can barely
protect himself, let alone you.

02:37.200 --> 02:38.960
Think carefully.

02:39.840 --> 02:42.240
Will you listen to a Liangya man

02:43.240 --> 02:45.000
or your prefect?

02:45.080 --> 02:47.240
What should we do now?

02:47.320 --> 02:48.000
Yeah.

02:48.080 --> 02:49.520
Exactly.

02:49.600 --> 02:50.760
What should we do?

02:51.840 --> 02:52.720
What now?

02:52.800 --> 02:54.160
Soldiers.

03:11.720 --> 03:13.080
My brother

03:13.160 --> 03:14.560
has been foolish for too long,

03:15.560 --> 03:18.000
which led Yanzhou to this state.

03:19.840 --> 03:21.920
If you don't betray me,

03:22.960 --> 03:24.120
I won't

03:24.960 --> 03:26.320
let your trust down.

03:27.120 --> 03:29.040
- Is the governor really dead?
- I heard the same.

03:29.120 --> 03:31.800
Even if he isn't, I support the prefect.

03:31.880 --> 03:33.040
The people believe him.

03:33.120 --> 03:35.880
- I support the prefect.
- Me too.

03:35.960 --> 03:37.040
Are you planning to rebel?

03:37.440 --> 03:39.000
Seize that Liangya man.

03:42.720 --> 03:43.920
Pass on my order.

03:44.800 --> 03:47.640
Yanzhou will no longer cooperate
with Liangya.

03:47.720 --> 03:51.840
Order Liancheng to mobilize all troops

03:51.920 --> 03:53.040
and retake Panyi.

03:53.680 --> 03:54.920
Yes.

04:11.000 --> 04:12.600
Prepare the finest coffin

04:14.520 --> 04:16.320
for General Wei Liang.

04:16.399 --> 04:17.279
Yes.

04:20.880 --> 04:22.840
THE GOVERNOR OF YANZHOU HAS DEFECTED
PLANNING TO RETAKE PANYI

04:23.480 --> 04:25.000
What can Qiao Ping do?

04:25.840 --> 04:27.400
It's like an ant shaking a tree.

04:27.920 --> 04:29.600
My lord, you'll surely win.

04:30.480 --> 04:31.240
However,

04:31.800 --> 04:34.320
we can't act rashly.

04:35.040 --> 04:36.720
We have Daqiao.

04:37.280 --> 04:38.360
Without Bi Zhi,

04:38.960 --> 04:40.560
Yanzhou is not a threat.

04:40.640 --> 04:41.560
Besides,

04:43.040 --> 04:45.080
I have a special gift

04:45.160 --> 04:46.160
for Wei Shao.

04:54.920 --> 04:56.960
YUJUN CITY, WEI STATE

05:17.680 --> 05:18.840
My lady,

05:20.280 --> 05:21.640
Yujun lacks troops as expected.

05:21.720 --> 05:24.040
Give me half a month,
and we can break through the gates.

05:24.800 --> 05:26.280
You really are a fierce general.

05:26.760 --> 05:29.520
Try your best to attack
with the Zhongzhou army.

05:29.600 --> 05:31.400
Deputy Liu Xiao and 5,000 elite troops

05:31.480 --> 05:32.720
will be under my command

05:32.800 --> 05:33.920
to conserve our strength.

05:35.240 --> 05:37.400
Yujun's troops were outnumbered,
but each one fought bravely.

05:37.480 --> 05:39.120
This battle was thrilling.

05:40.360 --> 05:41.960
Their bravery didn't matter.

05:42.040 --> 05:43.160
They still lost.

05:43.760 --> 05:44.920
General, you don't know.

05:45.480 --> 05:48.120
The real thrill is here.

05:48.200 --> 05:49.680
TRAPPED IN YONGNING

05:49.760 --> 05:53.760
Wei Shao was trapped in Yongning City
for days with reduced forces.

05:54.640 --> 05:56.080
Two days ago, he broke out,

05:56.520 --> 05:58.880
leading his leftover troops

05:58.960 --> 06:00.960
to Panyi.

06:02.040 --> 06:04.720
Wei Shao actually gave up Yujun for Panyi?

06:07.000 --> 06:09.320
Guess what would happen

06:09.400 --> 06:14.360
if Lady Qiao knew where Wei Shao had gone
when Yujun was under attack?

06:27.720 --> 06:30.520
His Lordship didn't abandon us.

06:30.600 --> 06:32.400
He did what a lord should do.

06:34.440 --> 06:35.960
Zhonglin has his mission.

06:36.560 --> 06:38.960
Yujun is counting on us now.

06:40.520 --> 06:43.520
But Yujun's not the only place
that's trapped.

06:43.600 --> 06:46.240
They're seriously outnumbered in Panyi.
It's extremely dangerous.

06:47.080 --> 06:51.400
If I can buy His Lordship some time
and hold back some troops,

06:51.480 --> 06:54.440
he will be able to take Panyi,
and peace will return.

06:54.800 --> 06:57.120
But Yujun already lacks troops.

06:57.520 --> 06:59.840
It might not hold out much longer.

07:00.720 --> 07:01.640
Well…

07:04.360 --> 07:05.280
My lady.

07:05.360 --> 07:06.200
How's the battle going?

07:06.560 --> 07:08.440
General Wei Xiao, General Qiao Ci, and I

07:08.520 --> 07:09.880
are guarding three city gates,

07:09.960 --> 07:11.320
but Xue Tai's forces are strong,

07:11.400 --> 07:13.080
and there's no capable commander
in the city.

07:13.800 --> 07:15.920
I fear we won't be able
to hold out for long.

07:16.000 --> 07:17.480
What should we do?

07:18.640 --> 07:20.520
Who says there's no capable commander
in the city?

07:38.320 --> 07:42.840
I've held back from attacking Wei State
out of respect for your ties with Wei!

07:43.240 --> 07:45.200
As for the rest, don't bring it up again.

07:45.760 --> 07:46.680
Young Master,

07:47.120 --> 07:47.960
this way, please.

07:56.480 --> 07:59.840
We have sworn to follow you,
so we'll only obey your orders.

07:59.920 --> 08:01.360
We'll only obey your orders.

08:01.440 --> 08:03.120
We're ready to go to battle with you.

08:06.120 --> 08:07.040
Grandmother,

08:08.280 --> 08:09.560
I'm back.

08:09.640 --> 08:10.800
Shiyuan.

08:13.080 --> 08:13.840
Shiyuan!

08:14.840 --> 08:15.720
Shiyuan.

08:16.640 --> 08:18.480
Shiyuan is back.

08:25.800 --> 08:27.040
Lady Xu of the Wei clan,

08:27.120 --> 08:31.080
today, Wei and Bianzhou
have formed an alliance

08:31.160 --> 08:32.440
over the canal project.

08:32.520 --> 08:34.640
Now, with Yujun under siege,

08:34.720 --> 08:37.080
I hope you can provide troops for me
to fight outside the city

08:37.159 --> 08:38.200
and defend Yujun together.

08:39.039 --> 08:39.919
Good.

08:40.480 --> 08:41.320
Good!

08:42.400 --> 08:43.440
I will give you troops.

08:44.800 --> 08:45.880
Shiyuan,

08:46.320 --> 08:49.800
you truly are the blood of the Wei clan.

08:53.320 --> 08:59.920
WEI MANSION

09:00.000 --> 09:00.720
Who are they?

09:01.120 --> 09:04.640
They are soldiers from Bianzhou
who came with me to help Yujun.

09:05.880 --> 09:06.960
They belong to Chen Pang?

09:07.040 --> 09:08.200
Yes.

09:08.280 --> 09:10.640
In the rush to help Yujun,
I neglected this.

09:11.000 --> 09:12.760
If you care about their identities,

09:13.600 --> 09:14.880
I will send them back.

09:14.960 --> 09:15.800
Shiyuan.

09:16.920 --> 09:19.480
Bianzhou and Wei have old grudges,

09:20.640 --> 09:22.800
but that's personal
between Chen Pang and me.

09:23.640 --> 09:27.320
Today, all of you followed Shiyuan here,

09:27.600 --> 09:30.520
risking your lives to support Yujun.

09:31.080 --> 09:32.640
You are the saviors of Wei.

09:33.680 --> 09:36.480
Please accept my gratitude.

09:37.560 --> 09:39.160
We chose to follow Mr. Wei,

09:39.240 --> 09:42.120
so we'll do our utmost
to live up to your trust.

09:42.760 --> 09:43.920
Please rise, everyone.

09:47.440 --> 09:48.200
Grandmother,

09:50.040 --> 09:50.920
I'm going.

09:52.960 --> 09:53.840
Be careful.

10:02.040 --> 10:04.440
WEI MANSION

10:11.720 --> 10:13.880
Let's hope they can return safely,

10:14.560 --> 10:16.520
and that lasting peace may come.

10:18.560 --> 10:20.320
When His Lordship triumphs,

10:20.920 --> 10:23.640
the grand scene you spoke of
will surely come true.

10:27.920 --> 10:30.600
PANYI CITY, YANZHOU

10:32.480 --> 10:36.280
QIAO

10:41.240 --> 10:42.840
QIAO

10:49.520 --> 10:53.160
PANYI

11:09.040 --> 11:10.120
Do we

11:10.520 --> 11:11.920
have to fight today?

11:12.000 --> 11:13.640
You treat me like family,

11:15.200 --> 11:16.840
but I have to fight against you

11:19.160 --> 11:20.600
because my wife

11:21.440 --> 11:22.600
is held hostage.

11:29.760 --> 11:30.440
Bi Zhi!

11:38.640 --> 11:39.520
Wei Shao.

11:53.520 --> 11:55.160
My lord, ignore our relationship.

11:57.000 --> 11:57.920
Attack.

12:07.840 --> 12:08.600
Bi Zhi,

12:09.600 --> 12:10.960
what are you waiting for?

12:11.440 --> 12:12.640
Strike!

12:20.080 --> 12:21.200
Bi Zhi, no!

12:34.240 --> 12:36.040
Bi Zhi is a fitting name.

12:36.520 --> 12:38.720
He's like a filthy animal.

12:39.600 --> 12:40.440
Look.

12:40.920 --> 12:44.720
Doesn't he look like a beast,
mindlessly controlled by others?

12:49.240 --> 12:52.080
Bi Zhi, if you don't hurt Wei Shao,

12:53.480 --> 12:55.280
I'll hurt your wife instead.

12:55.360 --> 12:58.600
How can you do this to him?

12:58.680 --> 13:02.440
We can only do this to him because of you.

13:03.800 --> 13:04.840
Let go!

13:08.120 --> 13:11.880
YUJUN CITY, WEI

13:15.480 --> 13:18.000
Kill them!

13:57.600 --> 13:58.600
General Xue is dead!

13:58.680 --> 13:59.640
Run!

13:59.720 --> 14:00.800
General Xue is dead!

14:00.880 --> 14:01.720
Run!

14:01.800 --> 14:02.560
Retreat!

14:02.640 --> 14:03.400
Retreat!

14:03.480 --> 14:06.560
YUJUN

14:13.040 --> 14:15.760
That green-eyed beast really is fierce.

14:16.120 --> 14:19.600
My lord, if Bi Zhi continues to serve you,

14:19.680 --> 14:23.680
I believe the realm
will eventually be yours.

14:24.800 --> 14:27.200
Fierce or not, he's just a wild animal.

14:27.280 --> 14:28.400
Yes.

14:38.960 --> 14:39.800
Bi Zhi,

14:40.320 --> 14:42.600
if you don't disable his limbs,

14:42.680 --> 14:44.880
I'll break your wife's.

14:47.560 --> 14:48.720
Bi Zhi!

14:49.160 --> 14:51.520
Stop being their puppet!

14:51.600 --> 14:53.120
Don't mind me!

15:08.760 --> 15:10.080
Bi Zhi is brave.

15:10.600 --> 15:12.720
If the world is divided,
he'll surely have a place.

15:13.400 --> 15:14.200
Sadly…

15:14.280 --> 15:15.720
Sadly, he's foolish enough

15:15.800 --> 15:17.840
to be tied down by a woman.

15:17.920 --> 15:19.520
Don't talk like that about him.

15:19.600 --> 15:20.560
Fool!

15:26.040 --> 15:28.640
If you don't do it, I'll push her down!

15:28.720 --> 15:29.800
Do it!

15:29.880 --> 15:30.920
I'll push her down!

15:31.520 --> 15:32.440
Bi Zhi!

15:34.280 --> 15:36.520
Bi Zhi, stop fighting!

15:41.240 --> 15:46.320
No one ever said we must always
do what's right, Manman.

15:47.080 --> 15:51.120
I would give my life for you
because you're my dearest cousin.

15:51.200 --> 15:53.920
But I can't let Bi Zhi die for you.

15:54.000 --> 15:58.040
I can't use love as a chain
to bind him into fighting for my clan.

15:58.800 --> 16:00.280
Not even for you.

16:01.600 --> 16:03.120
I will never regret it.

16:03.880 --> 16:05.680
I can't use love to force him

16:06.800 --> 16:08.440
and make him die

16:09.160 --> 16:10.560
for my family

16:11.480 --> 16:12.800
or even me.

16:14.040 --> 16:17.320
The one person I want to protect
has always been you.

16:18.560 --> 16:20.200
I will never regret it.

16:25.640 --> 16:26.920
Bi Zhi!

16:32.200 --> 16:33.880
You're the one I love,

16:34.720 --> 16:37.120
not a beast to be controlled.

16:38.760 --> 16:39.600
Darling,

16:40.760 --> 16:44.360
if you ever think back on today,

16:44.440 --> 16:45.800
just remember,

16:46.720 --> 16:48.280
I had no regrets.

16:52.480 --> 16:53.200
Don't jump!

17:25.599 --> 17:26.359
Fan…

17:34.640 --> 17:35.520
Fan…

17:36.600 --> 17:37.480
Fan…

17:43.960 --> 17:45.040
Fan…

17:46.040 --> 17:47.080
Fan, wake up.

17:49.120 --> 17:51.680
I don't want to be some commander.

17:53.080 --> 17:53.920
Fan,

17:54.240 --> 17:55.680
don't die.

17:55.760 --> 17:56.840
Please don't die.

17:58.280 --> 17:59.200
If you die,

18:00.680 --> 18:02.520
what should Li and I do?

18:04.400 --> 18:06.000
As long as you come back,

18:07.640 --> 18:09.680
I'll do anything.

18:11.560 --> 18:12.480
Fan!

18:13.760 --> 18:16.040
Fan!

18:19.360 --> 18:23.240
Fan!

18:56.480 --> 18:57.480
Liu Yan,

18:58.480 --> 19:01.480
I will make you pay in blood!

19:02.200 --> 19:03.920
I thought you could hold on longer,

19:04.480 --> 19:06.400
but it seems you're useless after all.

19:07.400 --> 19:09.320
So what if you two join forces?

19:10.200 --> 19:12.160
I have tens of thousands of troops here.

19:12.240 --> 19:14.640
That's more than enough to handle you.

19:17.840 --> 19:19.480
Xue Tai is dead. Liangya is defeated.

19:19.560 --> 19:21.040
Everyone, run for your lives!

19:22.840 --> 19:23.680
Retreat!

19:23.760 --> 19:24.680
Run!

19:25.080 --> 19:26.000
- Retreat!
- Run!

19:47.160 --> 19:48.840
Hurry, move faster!

19:48.920 --> 19:50.480
- She's coming back!
- Yes!

19:51.480 --> 19:52.560
Hurry. There's also this.

19:52.640 --> 19:53.480
Pack this up.

19:59.720 --> 20:01.240
You want to betray me too?

20:03.880 --> 20:04.800
We outnumber her.

20:04.880 --> 20:06.080
No need to fear her.

20:06.160 --> 20:07.280
Xue Tai is dead.

20:07.360 --> 20:08.400
No one can protect her now.

20:08.960 --> 20:10.480
Let's go and kill her.

20:11.000 --> 20:12.040
What are you doing?

20:12.120 --> 20:13.040
How dare you?!

20:14.520 --> 20:16.440
What are you doing?

20:16.520 --> 20:18.000
What are you doing?

20:20.720 --> 20:21.760
She's really disfigured!

20:21.840 --> 20:23.160
She's disfigured!

20:25.600 --> 20:27.160
Your face…

20:27.240 --> 20:28.480
Your face is ruined!

20:28.560 --> 20:29.600
She's really disfigured!

20:30.400 --> 20:31.840
You've all seen it.

20:32.520 --> 20:33.720
Don't expect to live.

20:34.240 --> 20:35.480
None of you can survive.

20:37.840 --> 20:38.680
Be careful!

20:43.360 --> 20:44.840
Don't kill me.

20:46.960 --> 20:47.880
Lady Yulou.

21:01.600 --> 21:02.440
Lady Yulou…

21:03.600 --> 21:04.720
Why?

21:06.600 --> 21:07.600
You've seen

21:08.320 --> 21:09.920
my face.

21:10.000 --> 21:11.880
I'm here to escort you away.

21:11.960 --> 21:12.840
No need.

21:14.440 --> 21:15.320
No need.

21:16.480 --> 21:19.440
If Liu Yan knew I looked like this now…

21:19.520 --> 21:22.000
He already knows.

21:23.240 --> 21:24.520
Lady Yulou,

21:24.600 --> 21:26.440
everything you eat, wear,

21:26.520 --> 21:28.200
and use in Liangya

21:28.280 --> 21:29.760
was arranged by the Lord of Liangya.

21:30.280 --> 21:31.280
How long

21:32.520 --> 21:33.960
could you have kept it a secret?

21:35.680 --> 21:36.720
His Lordship said

21:37.360 --> 21:38.800
that if we lost this battle,

21:39.720 --> 21:42.280
I should escort you to a safe place.

21:45.440 --> 21:47.680
He's arranged an escape for you.

21:48.320 --> 21:49.200
You…

22:11.280 --> 22:12.120
Impossible.

22:12.920 --> 22:16.400
You say no one ever cared about you,
but Brother loved you.

22:16.480 --> 22:17.720
Impossible.

22:18.160 --> 22:19.320
He cherished you.

22:20.600 --> 22:23.160
Even as he lay dying,
he asked me to look after you.

22:25.000 --> 22:26.040
Chen Xiang

22:26.960 --> 22:28.120
treated you well.

22:28.200 --> 22:29.480
He built you that pavilion

22:29.560 --> 22:31.080
and indulged your schemes for Wushan.

22:31.160 --> 22:32.240
Impossible.

22:36.840 --> 22:39.360
Liu Yan's love for me can't be real.

22:49.280 --> 22:51.600
But you ignored all their kindness.

22:52.080 --> 22:54.200
Instead of blaming so-called "unfairness,"

22:54.280 --> 22:57.680
why not ask yourself why you never saw
the love and care around you?

23:01.520 --> 23:02.400
It's over.

23:13.800 --> 23:16.320
Fate has abandoned me,

23:18.640 --> 23:22.480
making me miss again and again.

24:28.840 --> 24:30.200
Luckily, I didn't fail your trust.

24:31.080 --> 24:32.080
We've won

24:32.760 --> 24:33.600
this battle.

24:35.040 --> 24:36.200
We've won?

24:36.800 --> 24:37.760
Well done.

24:44.840 --> 24:46.600
May His Lordship win.

24:52.720 --> 24:55.000
Kill them!

25:10.080 --> 25:12.280
Kill them!

25:16.080 --> 25:17.400
Hold the flank!

25:17.480 --> 25:19.000
Don't let them climb up.

25:19.080 --> 25:20.000
Yes.

25:20.840 --> 25:23.360
My lord, Bi Zhi and Wei Shao
have gone mad.

25:23.440 --> 25:24.280
This place isn't safe.

25:24.360 --> 25:25.800
You should retreat to the rear.

25:25.880 --> 25:26.720
What?

25:27.400 --> 25:29.760
Do you think my army is weaker
than Wei Shao's?

25:29.840 --> 25:30.760
No.

25:30.840 --> 25:33.400
We outnumber Wei Shao's forces
by several to one.

25:34.080 --> 25:35.720
Even facing him head-on,

25:35.800 --> 25:37.200
I'm not afraid.

25:37.280 --> 25:38.760
Of course you're not afraid.

25:38.840 --> 25:40.680
But you needn't get hurt over this.

25:41.600 --> 25:44.000
If you hadn't sent 5,000 guards

25:44.080 --> 25:46.000
and General Liu Xiao
to protect Her Ladyship,

25:46.880 --> 25:48.720
I wouldn't be this worried.

25:50.400 --> 25:51.840
You don't want me to favor her?

25:53.440 --> 25:55.720
Pampered women grow arrogant.

25:55.800 --> 25:57.520
- Please listen to my advice as your uncle…
- Shut up!

25:59.200 --> 26:03.080
I swore to her that I'd kill
Wei Shao in this battle.

26:03.760 --> 26:04.920
Foolish.

26:05.320 --> 26:06.680
The one who conquers the world

26:06.760 --> 26:09.320
cannot be controlled by a woman.

26:10.160 --> 26:11.200
- Guards!
- Yes!

26:11.280 --> 26:12.640
Take His Lordship away.

26:13.400 --> 26:14.520
Move aside!

26:19.800 --> 26:21.120
I told you

26:22.000 --> 26:23.880
that my uncle is dead.

26:24.560 --> 26:26.000
If you can't accept that,

26:27.040 --> 26:28.320
then go die.

26:36.840 --> 26:38.200
If I kill Wei Shao,

26:40.000 --> 26:42.120
the realm will be mine.

26:43.600 --> 26:45.920
I'll be the ruler of the Central Plains.

27:38.560 --> 27:40.520
The soldiers of Wei are fierce.

27:43.840 --> 27:44.800
Wei Shao,

27:45.960 --> 27:47.400
even if you kill me,

27:48.200 --> 27:50.400
Wei will still drown in floods.

27:53.040 --> 27:54.120
You can't win against me.

28:03.680 --> 28:05.280
You can't win!

28:22.160 --> 28:23.160
My lady,

28:24.480 --> 28:25.920
I have broken my promise.

28:47.680 --> 28:49.160
When all states prosper,

28:49.240 --> 28:50.320
the world will have peace.

28:50.400 --> 28:52.040
The water from the Yang River
is accessible

28:52.120 --> 28:53.200
thanks to the Yongning Canal,

28:53.280 --> 28:55.720
which runs over 700 li,

28:55.800 --> 28:57.360
chasing the sun across the sky.

28:57.440 --> 29:00.320
The mighty stag
leaves north and goes south

29:00.600 --> 29:01.880
straight to Yujun.

29:02.200 --> 29:04.560
The mountains and rivers
stretch across the world,

29:04.840 --> 29:07.000
nurturing all living things.

29:07.360 --> 29:09.800
It's misty, yet there's no smoke.

29:09.880 --> 29:12.800
With the sun and moon reflecting in it,

29:12.880 --> 29:14.800
the spiritual energy from all directions

29:14.880 --> 29:16.200
gathers in the Central Plains,

29:16.280 --> 29:19.320
turning swords and blades to dust.

29:20.040 --> 29:21.400
The canal links nine states.

29:21.480 --> 29:22.720
It starts at Panyi,

29:23.120 --> 29:24.400
goes through Xindu,

29:24.480 --> 29:25.760
and stops at Rongjun,

29:25.840 --> 29:27.480
improving the traffic conditions,

29:28.000 --> 29:30.240
encouraging peace,
and driving away the spiteful.

29:30.320 --> 29:32.000
The next year after the completion,

29:32.080 --> 29:33.280
Wei Shao, Lord of Wei,

29:33.360 --> 29:35.160
and Liu Yan, Lord of Liangya,

29:35.240 --> 29:36.560
fought here.

29:36.960 --> 29:38.720
Scattered scars

29:38.800 --> 29:40.640
were lost in the long river.

29:42.800 --> 29:43.840
Good.

29:45.880 --> 29:46.880
Master Zhenshi,

29:47.560 --> 29:49.720
this poetic exposition is a masterpiece.

29:51.160 --> 29:53.040
But the 700 li

29:53.120 --> 29:55.600
was from Panyi to Xindu.

29:56.240 --> 29:57.680
Now that it reaches Rongjun,

29:57.760 --> 30:00.040
it's probably over 2,000 li,

30:00.400 --> 30:04.040
not to mention
the full length to other states.

30:06.920 --> 30:08.760
My lord, if you're not satisfied,

30:08.840 --> 30:12.120
shall I write another exposition
detailing the battle at Panyi that day?

30:13.400 --> 30:14.240
No need.

30:15.160 --> 30:17.280
These two lines are enough.

30:17.960 --> 30:19.360
Your exposition is so excellent

30:19.440 --> 30:21.200
that deserves to be carved
on stone tablets.

30:22.240 --> 30:23.600
But many things

30:24.160 --> 30:25.480
shouldn't be depicted in detail.

30:25.960 --> 30:28.160
No matter how fierce the war was,

30:28.240 --> 30:31.360
people tend to remember
the beautiful memories

30:31.440 --> 30:32.720
and those they truly liked.

30:34.920 --> 30:36.560
How wise and insightful.

30:36.640 --> 30:38.800
Your words make sense.

30:39.600 --> 30:41.720
Tomorrow, we'll offer the deer as a gift

30:42.120 --> 30:44.160
to honor Wei as the leader.

30:44.240 --> 30:45.240
My lord,

30:45.320 --> 30:46.480
please don't refuse.

30:46.560 --> 30:49.360
We'll honor Wei as the leader.

30:49.920 --> 30:50.760
All right.

30:52.000 --> 30:53.640
I won't fail your trust.

30:54.400 --> 30:57.440
I will lead the people
and create lasting peace.

30:57.520 --> 30:59.000
THE ODE TO YONGNING CANAL

30:59.080 --> 31:00.720
YUJUN

31:01.040 --> 31:05.320
I heard Chen Pang failed to bring Mr. Wei
back to his family before he died.

31:05.400 --> 31:07.800
It's a pity he died of asthma.

31:08.280 --> 31:09.520
That was mercy for him.

31:10.080 --> 31:12.040
Shiyuan is now the Lord of Bianzhou.

31:12.840 --> 31:15.520
Don't mention these things again.

31:16.200 --> 31:17.240
Yes.

31:30.480 --> 31:31.440
Grandmother.

31:31.520 --> 31:32.360
Shiyuan.

31:46.520 --> 31:47.960
Congratulations on the succession.

31:51.520 --> 31:54.800
May Bianzhou and Wei
remain forever friendly

31:55.600 --> 31:57.040
and share eternal peace.

31:58.800 --> 32:00.840
YUJUN

32:09.320 --> 32:12.760
KANGJUN, YANZHOU

33:55.840 --> 33:56.720
Fan,

33:57.160 --> 33:59.000
I will take good care of Li.

33:59.560 --> 34:00.360
Don't worry.

34:03.000 --> 34:04.800
We will remember Fan

34:05.280 --> 34:06.960
and those who have passed.

34:15.080 --> 34:16.320
Since you left,

34:17.480 --> 34:19.719
I've never gotten lucky
when drawing straws.

34:21.040 --> 34:23.520
Today, we brought good wine

34:25.120 --> 34:26.280
to come and see you.

34:27.960 --> 34:28.840
Cheers.

34:29.400 --> 34:31.639
GRAVE OF WEI LIANG

34:32.560 --> 34:33.920
Xiaotao came too.

34:53.040 --> 34:55.400
This is the orchid you brought back.

34:58.040 --> 34:58.960
I water it

34:59.840 --> 35:01.280
and give it sun

35:02.000 --> 35:03.400
every day.

35:04.560 --> 35:06.560
It's growing well now.

35:08.680 --> 35:10.040
You're the kind of man

35:10.400 --> 35:12.000
who can't keep promises.

35:13.040 --> 35:13.880
See?

35:15.200 --> 35:17.760
In the end, I'm the one bringing
the orchid to propose to you.

35:24.640 --> 35:26.760
Whether you're alive or dead,

35:28.800 --> 35:31.080
I still want to marry you.

35:31.880 --> 35:35.000
GRAVE OF WEI LIANG

35:42.360 --> 35:43.880
To us four,

35:44.480 --> 35:46.960
these miniature weapons
represent who we are.

35:48.080 --> 35:50.600
We weren't born on the same day,

35:51.240 --> 35:54.520
and I guess we won't die
on the same day either.

35:56.200 --> 35:57.120
But one day,

35:58.160 --> 36:00.160
even if all four of us are gone,

36:00.240 --> 36:02.120
burying these miniature weapons together

36:02.960 --> 36:04.800
will mean we'll always be brothers.

36:07.840 --> 36:08.840
Seeing it

36:09.320 --> 36:10.760
will be like seeing me.

36:16.360 --> 36:17.440
Is this a sign

36:17.520 --> 36:18.680
to stop fighting?

36:20.880 --> 36:23.720
How did you manage to say that
in such a circumstance?

37:38.920 --> 37:39.800
Sir.

37:40.560 --> 37:42.720
- Has His Lordship been found?
- He's not at the office.

37:44.240 --> 37:45.320
Sir.

37:45.400 --> 37:46.480
He's not the training ground.

37:47.920 --> 37:48.760
Sir.

37:49.640 --> 37:51.560
Lady Xu also said
she hadn't seen His Lordship.

37:52.440 --> 37:53.680
The deer offering ritual
is about to start.

37:53.760 --> 37:55.840
Without His Lordship,
how can the ritual be completed?

37:57.960 --> 37:59.160
Go fetch Lady Xu.

37:59.240 --> 38:02.680
Only she can accept the deer
on behalf of His Lordship.

38:02.760 --> 38:03.920
- Hurry.
- Yes.

38:11.960 --> 38:13.520
Don't cry.

38:15.440 --> 38:17.440
Stop crying.

38:19.640 --> 38:20.360
Don't cry.

38:24.600 --> 38:26.400
The ritual has started.

38:26.480 --> 38:27.880
Mr. Gongsun couldn't find you

38:27.960 --> 38:29.640
and brought Grandmother there.

38:29.720 --> 38:31.240
- Why are you here?
- Well.

38:31.320 --> 38:32.840
Feifei has been crying nonstop.

38:32.920 --> 38:34.480
I couldn't go.

38:36.720 --> 38:37.840
All right, there, there.

38:37.920 --> 38:38.840
Good girl.

38:38.920 --> 38:40.560
Come on.

38:41.440 --> 38:42.520
Go to your mother.

38:43.040 --> 38:44.200
Don't cry.

38:46.280 --> 38:47.320
You're amazing.

38:54.360 --> 38:58.040
Grandfather once compared living life
to conquering the world.

38:58.480 --> 39:01.760
He said both required equal strength.

39:02.280 --> 39:06.760
Now, I think those words
can be understood another way.

39:07.880 --> 39:11.080
Whether it's living life
or conquering the world,

39:11.720 --> 39:15.400
both sides working together is
the way to make things last.

39:17.240 --> 39:23.000
Luckily, my husband and I still understand
and are devoted to each other

39:23.080 --> 39:24.520
even after weathering many storms.

39:25.560 --> 39:27.360
He's willing to become my prisoner,

39:28.120 --> 39:30.160
and I'm willing to be his.

39:44.240 --> 39:49.640
WEI MANSION

39:52.040 --> 39:54.720
A few years later,
the Yongning Canal was completed.

39:55.280 --> 39:58.280
Now, the waterways are connected,
benefiting all sides.

39:58.360 --> 40:00.520
The world is no longer filled
with strife and hatred.

40:00.960 --> 40:02.840
The people are at peace.

40:04.440 --> 40:06.280
I've finally had
my lifelong wish come true

40:06.880 --> 40:09.800
by traveling with my wife
to see the world.

40:11.360 --> 40:14.040
Our thanks to our companions
on this journey.

40:14.120 --> 40:18.720
Everyone, in the years to come,
may all your wishes come true.

40:23.000 --> 40:26.120
THE END
